Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.83,0:00:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.34,0:00:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Akane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.01,0:00:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been putting in a lot of\Novertime lately. Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.43,0:00:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mommy!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mommy!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's all right, Mommy's here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here, let me wipe you off.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.15,0:00:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.74,0:00:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Banzai!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.99,0:00:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh?! She overworked\Nherself into a high fever{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.03,0:00:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and now she's regressed to childhood?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.33,0:00:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.33,0:00:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, how does one go\Nabout repairing a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.42,0:00:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, you should probably give\Nher some medicine and let her rest.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.43,0:00:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you've taken the\Nmedicine, it's time to go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.39,0:01:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna! I'm not sleepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.56,0:01:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna keep talking 'til I get tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.23,0:01:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Naked story time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.48,0:01:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey! Mommy! Do you love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. More than\Nanyone in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.07,0:01:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.91,0:01:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Same goes for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.74,0:01:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.33,0:01:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How come I'm so big all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.21,0:01:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yours are big, too, Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.46,0:01:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- You can touch them if you like.\N- Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, they're so soft!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.42,0:01:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to stop at rubbing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.51,0:01:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You can suck them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.08,0:01:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Bwuhhhhh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna nurse on your breasts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.73,0:01:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a baby anymore! I'm a...!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.73,0:01:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a... I'm a...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.02,0:01:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.23,0:01:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What am I?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.98,0:01:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.23,0:01:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I got a cold and I've\Nbeen with Mommy all day.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.99,0:01:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.82,0:01:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Me and Mom...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.16,0:02:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for causing such trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.63,0:02:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like your mother\Nwas a very kind woman, Akane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.17,0:02:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like she doted on you\Nfor longer than might be usual,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and that she really loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.26,0:02:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd never be able to take\Nthe place of a mother like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.18,0:02:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, she wasn't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.02,0:02:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,In actuality, my mom was the type\Nto just tell you "aw, just sleep it off,"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.03,0:02:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,not someone who'd ever\Nnurse someone back to health.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.99,0:02:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.61,0:02:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to have you\Nhere by my side, Nadeshiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.28,0:02:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.87,0:02:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So hey, Nadeshiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.75,0:02:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,About your master registration...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.71,0:03:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I still feel... kinda weird about treating\Nyou like you're property,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.05,0:03:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but... someday, I promise I'll\Nfind a way to go through with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.14,0:03:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you can just... be patient\Nwith me until then, I'd be... happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.61,0:03:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.90,0:03:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to keep honing my\Nsexual techniques until that day comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.11,0:03:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.62,0:03:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You and me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.24,0:03:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll do {\i1}so{\i0} much together!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.20,0:03:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll...
